<title>FRANCE: Eridania nine month sales rise 2.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Eridania nine month sales rise 2.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					40,066    vs   38,933</p>
<p>    - of which third quarter		  14,155    vs   13,217</p>
<p>NOTE - Eridania Beghin-Say said in the BALO official bulletin that it had recalculated the 1995 figures to reflect changes in foreign exchange rates and the company structure.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
